// E2412 with the console note (transport_links_design.md decision 17, §5.2): UART0 is the console of
// the ESP32-S3 board (rt_console.S, the USB-UART jack) and cannot be used as a link. The same code as
// a link the target does not provide, no separate sub-code; the message says the instance is the
// console and lists the links this board provides. Compile-failure trial (board driver --fail-one);
// the golden is the ESP32-S3 compiler's output.
carried_on console_line: (:serial) (:uart, 0, 115200);

fn main() -> int64 {
    0
}
